<title>USA: GRC International elects Wright chairman.</title>
<headline>GRC International elects Wright chairman.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>GRC International Inc on Monday said Joseph Wright was elected chairman of its board of directors.</p>
<p>Wright has served a GRC board member since November 1994. He is currently chairman and chief executive of AVIC Group International Inc</p>
<p>Wright takes over the chairmanship from Jim Roth, who remains GRC's president and chief executive.</p>
<p>GRC provides systems research and analysis, mainly to the U.S. government. It also makes electronics and software products.</p>
</text>
